      <h2>About Airborne Kite Centre</h2>
      <p>Airborne Kite Centre in Paje is an IKO-certified kitesurfing school offering lessons from beginner to advanced, foil boarding, and wing foiling. Certified instructors, latest Duotone and Cabrinha gear, and rescue boat. Paje&#x27;s shallow lagoon and consistent cross-onshore winds make it a world-class learning destination. Lessons by the hour or multi-day packages. Equipment rental and storage available.</p>

